# Example env file for engagement devcontainers. Real values live in
# org/conf/devcontainer.env (gitignored), which newPT.sh copies into each new
# engagement's .devcontainer/.env. Edit that master file once with your keys.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Claude Code keeps itself current: the container install is native and
# user-owned (~/.local/share/claude/versions/), so the built-in autoupdater can
# replace the binary in place — a container built weeks ago catches up on the
# next launch. Uncomment to freeze it at the version baked into the image
# instead (engagements that must stay byte-reproducible, or air-gapped runs):
# DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER=1

# Common optional keys — uncomment as needed:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# SHODAN_API_KEY=
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
